{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/endomorphosis/ipfs_datasets_py/pulls/1304","id":4857071976,"node_id":"PR_kwDOLq3nQc8AAAABIYEJaA","html_url":"https://github.com/endomorphosis/ipfs_datasets_py/pull/1304","diff_url":"https://github.com/endomorphosis/ipfs_datasets_py/pull/1304.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/endomorphosis/ipfs_datasets_py/pull/1304.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/endomorphosis/ipfs_datasets_py/issues/1304","number":1304,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Archive completed actor context ranking experiment and verified weights","user":{"login":"endomorphosis","id":3405202,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MDUyMDI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3405202?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/endomorphosis","html_url":"https://github.com/endomorphosis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/endomorphosis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/endomorphosis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/endomorphosis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/endomorphosis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/endomorphosis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/endomorphosis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/endomorphosis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/endomorphosis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/endomorphosis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The actor context ranking decoder now has a completed, fixed 32-update experiment with frozen outputs, a separate recount, independent result review, and a verified Hugging Face archive. It starts from F15 and adds filtered actor-span ranking to the existing normalized loss while keeping nonactor tensors frozen.\n\nTraining actor accuracy improves from 156/168 to 158/168; complete-rule accuracy stays 154/168. Authored development gains two complete rules on both decoding routes, while one older tuning rule regresses. Scientific acceptance fails and the candidate is not promoted. All nine score panels and the loss ID are retained in the guide and evidence.\n\nValidation covers the fixed recipe, initial parity, protected final score vectors, resource closure, all 62 frozen files, scoring/recount agreement, and independent reviews. The immutable HF release has 201 forcibly downloaded, byte-exact files and preserves all 5,646 original identities. The original upload failure, exact attributes correction, and finite resume are preserved separately. No statutory semantic, active 8D/384D/768D comparison, new Lean build, portable numerical reload, or hosted CI pass is claimed.\n\nThis integration preserves the newer source main and both earlier F16 draft commits. The original training checkout and frozen resource-source paths remain intact. The guide documents the next joint-readout design as an unimplemented proposal.\n\nHF release: https://huggingface.co/Publicus/legal-ir-autoencoder/tree/f5bebab6d6a75c2e4cd1ed1fa09eb3481e1dcd14/releases/20261014-actor-context-ranking-v1\n","created_at":"2026-10-14T11:19:46Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T13:52:20Z","closed_at":"2026-10-14T13:52:20Z","merged_at":"2026-10-14T13:52:20Z","merge_commit_sha":"4b50ae4aac65da9166bd3b24608f32ba7e9fb23d","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/endomorphosis/ipfs_datasets_py/pulls/1304/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/endomorphosis/ipfs_datasets_py/pulls/1304/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/endomorphosis/ipfs_datasets_py/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/endomorphosis/ipfs_datasets_py/issues/1304/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/endomorphosis/ipfs_datasets_py/statuses/8bed92e201e437503f88f14